      "writtenOn": "2024-07-12T15:26:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure whether we want to bake a low-level balloon API into VirtualMachine. It may limit our room for manoeuver in future, eg moving to a smarter automated scheme like ChromeOS implemented.\n\nSo, I implemented the non-contentious stuff in this CL. And then for the client-facing stuff I wonder if this would do, via @hidden APIs on VirtualMachine:\n1. @hide void disableAutoTrim(void)\n2. @hide long getMemoryBalloon(void)\n3. @hide void setMemoryBalloon(long)\n\nWDYT?",
